{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17239","headline":"初秋月夜中书宿直因呈杨阁老 · 权德舆","name":"初秋月夜中书宿直因呈杨阁老","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"欹枕直庐暇，风蝉迎早秋。\n沈沈玉堂夕，皎皎金波流。\n对掌喜新命，分曹谐旧游。\n相思翫华彩，因感庾公楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17239.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17239","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}